<title>BELGIUM: Belgian robbers raid bank in wheelchair.</title>
<headline>Belgian robbers raid bank in wheelchair.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two armed robbers, one arriving in a wheelchair, held up a bank in the Belgian city of Liege on Wednesday, Belga news agency reported.</p>
<p>Once inside the bank, the wheelchair attacker produced a shotgun and his accomplice brandished a handgun.</p>
<p>Both men left the bank on foot, abandoning the wheelchair, and made their getaway in a stolen car.</p>
</text>
